    ('2d7a696c-ec13-5ffe-afc9-1c0cabd28152', '3dfaae20-fc10-511a-b24f-9e68bd8a9bbb', 1, 'Whether to aim for faster growth or a better ______ of work and leisure cannot be answered by data alone.', NULL,
